/*
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------
| {{name}} Module Manifest
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------
|
| title          : Module title shown in the sidebar & roles page.
|                  May be a string or an array keyed by locale.
| description    : Optional module description (string or locale array).
| enabled        : Set to false to hide the module completely.
| priority       : Sort order for the roles page permission groups.
| icon / color   : Default icon & accent color (see partials/module-nav/colors.blade.php).
| permissions    : Permission definitions:  'prefix.action' => ['tr' => ..., 'en' => ...].
|                  Grouped on the roles page by the prefix part.
| menu           : Sidebar sections. Types: "link" or "group".
|                  link:   title, icon, color, route, permission, active (route patterns)
|                  group:  title, icon, color, permission (string|array, can-any), children[]
|                  order  : integer, global sidebar position.
| groups         : Optional overrides for the roles page grouping.
| routes         : Optional route file, loaded inside the admin prefix
|                  with the auth+verified middleware group.
| views / lang   : Optional directories auto-registered as view/translation namespaces.
| migrations     : Optional directory of module migrations (auto-loaded).
|
*/

